## full config
{
  "body_template": "{\"text\": \"{{summary}}\"}",
  "content_type": "json",
  "headers": {
    "X-Golden": "yes"
  },
  "method": "POST",
  "url": "https://example.com/hooks/vigilant"
}

### down
POST https://example.com/hooks/vigilant
X-Golden: yes
(raw application/json)
{"text": "🔴 Payments API is down — HTTP 503 (after 3 retries)"}

### up
POST https://example.com/hooks/vigilant
X-Golden: yes
(raw application/json)
{"text": "🟢 Payments API is back up — down for 12m 4s"}
